                  "value": "C",
                  "text": "information from her tutor's contacts in other countries"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "Q32",
              "text": "What types of people were included in the research?",
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "A",
                  "text": "young people in their first job"
                },
                {
                  "value": "B",
                  "text": "men who were working"
                },
                {
                  "value": "C",
                  "text": "women who were unemployed"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "Q33",
              "text": "Shona says that in her questionnaire her aim was",
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "A",
                  "text": "to get a wide range of data"
                },
                {
                  "value": "B",
                  "text": "to limit people's responses"
                },
                {
                  "value": "C",
                  "text": "to guide people through interviews"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "Q34",
              "text": "What do Shona's initial results show about medical services in Britain?",
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "A",
                  "text": "Current concerns are misrepresented by the press"
                },
                {
                  "value": "B",
                  "text": "Financial issues are critical to the government"
                },
                {
                  "value": "C",
                  "text": "Reforms within hospitals have been unsuccessful"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "Q35",
              "text": "Shona needs to do further research in order to",
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "A",
                  "text": "present the government with her findings"
                },
                {
                  "value": "B",
                  "text": "decide the level of extra funding needed"
                },
                {
                  "value": "C",
                  "text": "identify the preferences of the public"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "Q36",
              "text": "Shona has learnt from the research project that",
              "options": [
